/-!
# Witnesses for a homogeneous cyclic basis

These auxiliary literals are generated from the unchanged seed witness by
`Multiplication/source/generate.py`. They claim no identities. The selected
monomials are ordered by degree and lexicographically within each degree.
Their tails are again selected monomials. `Checks` certifies these data in Lean.
The published `algebraBasis` is kept in its original order.
-/

